# Git workflow

## Branches

| Branch | Role |
|--------|------|
| `dev` | Integration / development — verified work lands here |
| `main` | Production — **protected**; agents must not push here |

- Feature work on `dev` (Lane S) or `orchestrator/<TASK-ID>` branches (Lane P).
- **Never push** unless the user explicitly asks.
- **Never push to `main`** from agents.

## Commit messages (Conventional Commits)

Subject ≤72 chars, imperative mood, **scoped**. Task commits link work items per `07-kaneo-commit-linking.mdc`.

```
feat(<scope>)[#123]: <summary>
fix(<scope>)[#123]: <summary>
chore(<scope>)[P2-01]: <summary>   # roadmap-only when no Kaneo mirror
```

**Allowed scopes**: api, web, mobile, shared, infra, docs, roadmap, ci

Plan-file verifier commits: `chore(plan)[#123]: mark P8-07 verified`

Session memory (`.agents/project/agent-memory/`) is **gitignored** — never commit session files.

## Staging

Stage explicit paths only. Never `git add .` or `git add -A`.

## Push policy

Agents default to **local commits only**. Full CI gate before push when user explicitly requests push (see `06-local-ci-before-commit.mdc`).
